\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2\">REAL</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\">Oct 3 · 20:00–20:44:18 · 44:18 tracked</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Session context actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\"><button data-name=\"Return to replay\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional arrow-left-line icon\" class=\"ri-arrow-left-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\"></i>Return to replay</button></div></div><div data-name=\"Learning within Review\" class=\"max-w-[1280px] w-full mx-auto px-7 pb-6 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-3\"><div data-name=\"Evidence-backed observation\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\"><p data-name=\"Section eyebrow\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium tracking-[1.7px] text-[#AEB7C5]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">OBSERVATION</p><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[28px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">Viewer activity increased during M03.</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\">Observed association in a partial metric window. Product presentation was operator reported.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4\"><span data-name=\"With later evidence · Received 21:05 status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8B2FF]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional history-line icon\" class=\"ri-history-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2\">With later evidence · Received 21:05</span></span><button data-name=\"Open supporting records\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2\"><i data-name=\"Functional arrow-right-line icon\" class=\"ri-arrow-right-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-1\"></i>Open supporting records</button></div></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_420px] gap-6 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\"><div data-name=\"Interpretation space\" class=\"py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1\"><p data-name=\"Section eyebrow\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium tracking-[1.7px] text-[#AEB7C5]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-1\">INSIGHT</p><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-2\">The sizing cue may matter more than sequence.</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-3\">Similar questions appeared before and after M03. The record does not establish a cause.</p><button data-name=\"Edit interpretation\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4\"><i data-name=\"Functional edit-line icon\" class=\"ri-edit-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-1\"></i>Edit interpretation</button></div><div data-name=\"Testable hypothesis\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2\"><p data-name=\"Section eyebrow\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium tracking-[1.7px] text-[#AEB7C5]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1\">HYPOTHESIS</p><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-2\">Test M03 earlier with the same sizing cue.</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-3\">Keep the cue stable; compare a defined activity window and note provider gaps.</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-4\">Uncertainty: partial data, changed audience, operator reports only.</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Actionable reusable plan change\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\"><div data-name=\"Row\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 \" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\"><div data-name=\"Row main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1\"><p data-name=\"Section eyebrow\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium tracking-[1.7px] text-[#DFFF00]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1-1\">NEXT-LIVE CHANGE</p></div><div data-name=\"Row actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2\"><span data-name=\"Proposed status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-edit-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-edit-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-2\">Proposed</span></span></div></div><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\">Move M03 before Flash Sale.</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3\">Add “show pockets + sizing” to the cue. Both edits remain proposals until accepted.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex gap-3 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4\"><button data-name=\"Accept change\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#DFFF00] text-[#111407] hover:bg-[#CBEA00]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Accept change\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional check-line icon\" class=\"ri-check-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1-1\"></i>Accept change</button><button data-name=\"Reject\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reject\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2\">Reject</button><button data-name=\"Edit\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-3\"><i data-name=\"Functional edit-line icon\" class=\"ri-edit-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-3-1\"></i>Edit</button></div><button data-name=\"Preview next LIVE\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-5\"><i data-name=\"Functional arrow-right-line icon\" class=\"ri-arrow-right-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-5-1\"></i>Preview next LIVE</button></div></div></div></div>",
